  "analysis_rules":[
    "A keyword match is not evidence of affiliation, criminal conduct, terrorist status, or intent.",
    "A location is not evidence that an individual or organization operated there.",
    "Separate source statements, official designations, court findings, accusations, and verified facts.",
    "Do not treat simulated neural variables as biological neural measurements.",
    "Do not store credentials, private keys, authentication tokens, or unnecessary private-person data.",
